      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "This is an old post, but the ability to toggle specific post-processing functions such as chromatic aberration and film grain specifically would go a VERY long way for people like myself. Chromatic aberration does not work very well in VR and just makes things very blurry. Film grain is the bane of my existence as I have visual snow syndrome and film grain effects just make my symptoms worse. Ambient occlusion is just broken in VRChat with the renderer being used in VR and just shouldn't even be enabled in VR to begin with.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
